---
---
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-left reveal reveal-left">
    <p class="section-label" style="color: rgba(200,255,0,0.6);">Who I Am</p>
    <h2>Crafting Bold <span>Visual Stories</span></h2>
    <p>I'm a passionate graphic designer from Malang, East Java, with over 6 years of experience helping brands build
      strong visual identities. I believe great design is more than aesthetics — it's communication.</p>
    <p>From logo creation to complete brand systems, I bring ideas to life with precision and creativity, ensuring
      every pixel serves a purpose.</p>

    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-item reveal">
        <div class="skill-item-top"><span>Brand Identity</span><span class="skill-pct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="skill-bar">
          <div class="skill-fill" data-width="95" style="width:0%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item reveal">
        <div class="skill-item-top"><span>UI/UX Design</span><span class="skill-pct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="skill-bar">
          <div class="skill-fill" data-width="80" style="width:0%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item reveal">
        <div class="skill-item-top"><span>Illustration</span><span class="skill-pct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="skill-bar">
          <div class="skill-fill" data-width="85" style="width:0%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item reveal">
        <div class="skill-item-top"><span>Print Design</span><span class="skill-pct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="skill-bar">
          <div class="skill-fill" data-width="90" style="width:0%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-right reveal reveal-right">
    <p class="section-label" style="color: rgba(200,255,0,0.6); margin-bottom: 20px;">What I Offer</p>
    <div class="services-list">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C8FF00" stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z" />
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5" />
            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="service-info">
          <h4>Brand Identity & Logo</h4>
          <p>Complete visual identity systems — logo, color palette, typography, and brand guidelines that make you
            unforgettable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C8FF00" stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" />
            <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="service-info">
          <h4>Social Media Design</h4>
          <p>Instagram, TikTok, and LinkedIn content — posts, stories, reels thumbnails, and full content kits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C8FF00" stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9" />
            <path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2" />
            <rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="service-info">
          <h4>Print & Packaging</h4>
          <p>Brochures, banners, flyers, product packaging, and any print material ready for production.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C8FF00" stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z" />
            <path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z" />
            <path d="M2 2l7.586 7.586" />
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="service-info">
          <h4>Digital Illustration</h4>
          <p>Custom illustrations, character design, infographics, and visual storytelling for any platform.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
